,{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは岐阜来たことある？あるならどこ行った？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ないのー！ごめんー！！ ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.好きなひらがなはなんですか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.にっこり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.好きなアイドルちゃんはいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ＡＫＢ48さん、ぱすぽさん、アイドリングさん、ももクロさん！みんな可愛いし好きですよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみの、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ごめんなたーい」とかっていうのは、メンバーと話す時も使っているのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん、全然使ってない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃんわメンバーからなんてよばれてるん??あだ名みたいなのある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみあみ、能條、能條愛未。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上この三つ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/26/1861035/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃまた明日朝早いので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばいあみあみ！"}],"source":"archive"}